<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 3,638 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 3,638 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 3,638 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,625 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					Aug 29		  Aug 28</p>
<p> Mark rate			   3,638		    3,625</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    3.28			1.87</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
